  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/smol-machines/smolvm/zipball/v1.15.0",
  "body": "## What's Changed\n* README: the virglrenderer loader path for Nix and NixOS hosts by @NickyHeC in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1224\n* Fix the flake's release hashes and stop the cut from half-bumping nix/smolvm.nix by @NickyHeC in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1225\n* Surface the guest console in a boot failure so the real reason is not lost by @NickyHeC in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1229\n* Make a smaller storage disk work for a Nix install on macOS by @NickyHeC in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1227\n* Report a machine's real memory in status by asking the guest instead of the host by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1230\n* Let a machine run its own hypervisor by exposing the host's virtualization extensions by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1231\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.14.6...v1.15.0",
  "mentions_count": 2
